SPARTA (24 Sep 2025)
Running on 4 MPI task(s)
################################################################################
# thermal nitrogen gas in a 3d box with dissociation chemistry, exercised
# through a write_restart / read_restart round trip
#
# Regression coverage for restart serialization, which no other enabled test
# exercises in a self-contained deck.  The run is stopped halfway, written to a
# restart file, the entire state is cleared, the restart file is read back, and
# the run is continued.  Because the gas is colliding and reacting (the particle
# count and species mix evolve), any corruption of the serialized particle,
# grid, or species state would change the post-restart thermo output and fail
# the comparison to the gold-standard log.
#
# Note:
#  - The "comm/sort" option to the "global" command is used to match MPI runs.
#  - The "twopass" option is used to match Kokkos runs.
# The "comm/sort" and "twopass" options should not be used for production runs.
################################################################################

seed	    	    12345
dimension   	    3
global              gridcut 1.0e-5 comm/sort yes

boundary	    rr rr rr

create_box  	    0 0.0001 0 0.0001 0 0.0001
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (0.0001 0.0001 0.0001)
create_grid 	    10 10 10
WARNING: Could not acquire nearby ghost cells b/c grid partition is not clumped (/home/user/sparta/src/grid.cpp:473)
Created 1000 child grid cells
  CPU time = 0.000936785 secs
  create/ghost percent = 94.6806 5.31936
balance_grid        rcb part
Balance grid migrated 740 cells
  CPU time = 0.000739242 secs
  reassign/sort/migrate/ghost percent = 41.655 0.302066 15.4519 42.5911

species		    air.species N2 N
mixture		    air N2 N vstream 0.0 0.0 0.0 temp 20000.0
mixture             air N2 frac 1.0
mixture             air N frac 0.0

global              nrho 7.07043E22
global              fnum 7.07043E5

collide		    vss air air.vss
react               tce air.tce

create_particles    air n 10000 twopass
Created 10000 particles
  CPU time = 0.00144718 secs

stats		    100
compute             temp temp
stats_style	    step cpu np nattempt ncoll nreact c_temp

timestep 	    7.00E-9
run 		    500
